{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062330/extras/e0cb3401b43e078525d33d5ffa49f991.avif?t=1756467465\" data-has-big width=800 height=144 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever wondered what it's like to have a loving Father? Well, wonder no more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Proud Dad Simulator</strong> gives you the loving father you wish you had growing up! Simply click Dad to receive an affirmation and then delve deeper into this clicker-style game to unlock microgames and collect all achievements. Can you discover all of dads wacky affirmations? It's finally your chance to feel loved!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062330/extras/bfae9e62fa99898364692655b8452f1f.avif?t=1756467465\" data-has-big width=800 height=147 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're working on that college entry essay, fighting that boss, or enjoying your hobby - Proud Dad Simulator is always there to provide you the positive affirmation you so desperately crave thanks to its world-famous &quot;Porta-Dad&quot; window. Your new Proud Dad is just a click away.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dadware! - 10 Dadtastic Microgames</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062330/extras/3c0095b4be14efbf2f05f44944f62fc6.avif?t=1756467465\" data-has-big width=800 height=151 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To unlock new affirmations you must successfully help Dad clear through  <strong>Dad-Themed microgames</strong>! Show off your golfing skills, ninja-chop milk crates with perfect timing, try your hand at perfect parallel parking, and much more in this retro inspired microgame collection. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >13 unique achievements</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dad-tastic features:  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 Unique &quot;Fatherly Affirmations&quot; (FA) to discover!  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speedrun your way to parental approval with Speedrunner Mode! </strong>Beat the game in one go to submit your record time to the Proud Dad Simulator Speedrun leaderboard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your very own father, now rendered in charming pixel art! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dad, Father, Papa </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can <strong>YOU</strong> become dads favorite son?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062330/extras/94586d42cbcf70825cef7c8eccdbff6d.poster.avif?t=1756467465\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062330/extras/94586d42cbcf70825cef7c8eccdbff6d.webm?t=1756467465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Dad is proud of you","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3062330/658686419674437385bc7d0bc793f719efb4ebd6.jpg"},{"name":"Dad loves mom","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3062330/8e86caa61633a3cb32be3a1b0ab5294a03df3a6d.jpg"},{"name":"Dad loves fishing","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3062330/867f93d3dd29202586ec5ed3c845bfa18ae035cb.jpg"},{"name":"Dad loves you","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3062330/bb22b1b58d460d032d1c08091b839276c7b6e3eb.jpg"},{"name":"Dad loves not hitting you","path":"https://c